{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1467200-curiosities","id":1467200,"title":"Curiosities","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-08T15:03:30-08:00","id":1467200,"title":"Curiosities","content":"I am developing a new chronicle for some friends and I need a list of Curiosities. The Prince rules by what he calls the Three Blood Law. In essence he rates each violation of Tradition or Curiosity by severity where one is a low crime and 3 is a blood hunt. Every time a Cainite breaches a tradition or Curiosity the Prince has a blood mark placed upon the offender. Marks are cumulative. In addition, the offender must either drink of the Prince's blood or allow him to drink of them. The Latter is more common than the former. The Prince is a Banu Haqim. I was hoping to use the Nuclear Clock tool to track the Prince's descent into madness. I have a few basic Curiosities but I need more as the Prince degenerates. The closer the clock moves to midnight the more curiosities the Prince enacts. <br /> <br /> Any ideas. <br /> <br /> I already have feeding restrictions against feeding from first responders and a ban against false witness.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","name":"Chris Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}